# Plan — Task 169-008 H1 ADR DB→FS Export Pipeline + ADR-046 Reverse Hook

## Goal
Bridge Sprint 167 Bug R gap: 43+ ADRs in `memory.db` (entries WHERE type='adr')
but only 9 `.md` files in `docs/adr/`. Add DB→FS export pipeline + amend
ADR-046 to formalize bi-directional sync contract.

## Steps

### 1. `src/core/memory-export.ts` — Add `exportAdrsToFs()`
- Signature: `exportAdrsToFs(store, adrDir, opts?) → AdrFsExportResult`
- Result type:
  - `written: number` — new .md files created
  - `updated: number` — existing .md files rewritten (DB newer)
  - `skipped: number` — existing .md mtime > DB updated_at → preserve manual edits
  - `errors: string[]`
  - `ids: string[]` — ADR ids touched (written + updated)
- File naming: `docs/adr/<NNN>-<kebab-title>.md` where NNN = numeric part of id
  - kebab-title from `entry.title` (lowercase, spaces → `-`, non-alnum stripped)
  - If file with matching `<NNN>-*.md` already exists → reuse its name (preserve)
- MADR v3 body template (when content lacks the structure):
  - `# ADR-<NNN>: <title>`
  - `**Status:** <status>`
  - `**Date:** <created_at or updated_at YYYY-MM-DD>`
  - `**Sprint:** <sprint_id or "_To be backfilled_">`
  - `---`
  - Then existing entry.content (or `_To be backfilled_` if empty)
- Idempotency: if file exists AND `statSync(file).mtimeMs > Date.parse(entry.updated_at)`
  → skip (manual edit wins). Otherwise overwrite atomically.
- Missing fields → emit `_To be backfilled_` placeholder.

### 2. `scripts/memory/export-adr-fs.mjs` — CLI wrapper
- Argv parsing: `--dry-run`, `--adr-dir <path>`, `--db <path>`
- Defaults: db=`.brain/memory.db`, adr-dir=`docs/adr`
- Imports `MemoryStore` + `exportAdrsToFs` from compiled dist
  (use `../../dist/core/memory-store.js` style, but tests don't need dist)
- Prints summary table

### 3. `tests/core/adr-fs-export.test.ts` — 3 TDD tests
- Test 1: complete export — 3 ADRs in DB, empty docs/adr → 3 .md files written
- Test 2: partial placeholder — ADR with empty sprint_id → `_To be backfilled_`
- Test 3: idempotent — second run, no DB changes, files with newer mtime → skipped=3

### 4. `docs/adr/046-brain-self-update-hook-architecture.md` — Amendment
- Add `## Amendment — Sprint 169 (Bi-Directional Hook Contract)` section
- Marker: `Amendment 2026-05-15` for grep proof (task requires "Amendment 2026-05-15" grep match)
- Document FS↔DB sync direction:
  - Forward: `syncAdrFilesToDb` (Sprint 166 Bug M — Step 3)
  - Reverse: `exportAdrsToFs` (Sprint 169 H1)
  - Conflict resolution: file mtime > DB updated_at → DB consumes from FS;
    DB updated_at > file mtime OR file missing → FS consumes from DB

## Verify
- `tsc --noEmit` clean
- `npx vitest run tests/core/adr-fs-export.test.ts`
- `grep "Amendment 2026-05-15" docs/adr/046-*.md` ≥ 1 match

## Out of Scope
- Bulk backfill of 43 ADRs into docs/adr/ — pipeline added; actual seeding deferred
  to scripts/memory/export-adr-fs.mjs run by Brain
- Relations table backfill (dependency 169-003 territory)
